<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>chat.attach.imagesNotSeen</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>這個模型不能看圖，%lld 張圖片沒有交給模型。可到設定的模型頁打開「能看圖」。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>chat.attach.photoCount</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 張照片</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>chatMcpOmitted</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>這次有 %lld 個 MCP 工具或資源超出一次回覆的上限，沒有提供給模型。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>document.protectedCells</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>已將 %lld 個疑似公式的儲存格加上單引號，避免當成公式執行。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>drawer.recent.turns</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
